Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.91,0:22:32.29,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}その瞳に映る全部を守りたい
