Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.91,0:23:09.58,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}きみが世界の何処に居ようとも
